[2025-04-15 21:52:15,604][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-6 << "[0x9][0x9]<category><![CDATA[Mark Lanterman]]></category>[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:15,604][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-6 << "[0x9][0x9]<category><![CDATA[mark rasch]]></category>[\n]"
