[2025-04-15 21:52:15,689][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-6 << "[0x9][0x9]<link>https://krebsonsecurity.com/2025/03/arrests-in-tap-to-pay-scheme-powered-by-phishing/</link>[\n]"
