[2025-04-15 21:52:20,222][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Hertz has reported a data breach that affects customers across multiple regions due to a cyberattack on vendor Cleo Software between October and December 2024. Exposed data includes names, contact information, driver&apos;s licenses, payment details, and some Social Security numbers.[\n]"
