[2025-04-15 21:52:20,224][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Communication protocols are vital for AI Agent development. Anthropic&apos;s MCP connects agents to external tools, while Google&apos;s A2A enables agent collaboration. This post dives into security vulnerabilities in these protocols that could lead to agent hijacking and data leakage.[\n]"
