[2025-04-15 21:52:20,321][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,321][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    A threat actor, &apos;Jabaroot,&apos; claims to have breached Morocco&apos;s National Social Security Fund (CNSS), compromising the data of nearly 2 million citizens. The leak includes personal and financial details like passports, emails, and banking information, posing significant identity theft and fraud risks for those affected.[\n]"
