[2025-04-15 21:52:20,502][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Cisco Talos i"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,503][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "s tracking an ongoing campaign targeting users in Ukraine with malicious LNK files that resemble war-related files to eventually download the Remcos backdoor. The LNK files run a PowerShell command to launch a decoy file and download the second-stage zip file containing the backdoor. The second stage payload then uses DLL side-loading to execute the Remcos payload. Cisco believes that this campaign is associated with Gamaredon.[\n]"
