[2025-04-15 21:52:20,524][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                        &lt;strong&gt;Microsoft Credits EncryptHub, Hacker Behind 618+ Breaches, for Disclosing Windows Flaws (3 minute read)&lt;/strong&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,524][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    &lt;/span&gt;[\n]"
