[2025-04-15 21:52:20,529][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    A vulnerability in Google&apos;s Quick Share (CVE-2024-10668) for Windows permitted unauthorized file transfers. The flaw, fixed in version 1.0.2002.2, could be exploited to bypass security and cause denial-of-service attacks.[\n]"
