[2025-04-15 21:52:20,537][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    A vulnerability in Verizon&apos;s Call Filter feature revealed the incoming call logs of certain customers due to an insecure API request. This issue was identified by a security researcher and was addressed by Verizon within a month. The flaw enabled unauthorized access to call histories, which could jeopardize user privacy.[\n]"
