[2025-04-15 21:52:20,538][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,538][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Model Context Protocol (MCP) is an open standard that connects AI models and agentic applications to various data sources and tools. Standard MCP implementations do not include built-in approval, lack comprehensive prompt monitoring, and can require complex privilege management. This post provides reference architectures for exposing tools and creating secure and authenticated model interactions and general MCP security best practices.[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,538][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                &lt;/span&gt;[\n]"
