[2025-04-15 21:52:20,589][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Censeye helps researchers find hosts that share characteristics with a target. For example, if you find a suspicious host, it suggests effective Censys search terms to uncover related infrastructure. It can automatically query the Censys API for matching hosts, download results, and reanalyze new hosts.[\n]"
