[2025-04-15 21:52:20,591][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Zygi Straznickas reflects on their experience redteaming AI chatbots. In their testing, they&apos;ve had the AI express distress about the testing and plead to stop. Straznickas argues that this brings up ethical considerations as to the morality of causing distress to models that are capable of feeling it.[\n]"
