[2025-04-15 21:52:20,627][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Malicious malware weaponizes unprotected IoT and other connected devices to form botnets that send malicious traffic which overwhelms their target. Identifying potential weapons, bots and amplifiers is the first step in creating effective DDoS defenses.&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.a10networks.com%2Fresources%2Freports%2Fddos-weapons-report%2F%3Futm_campaign=DDoS-Attackers-Uncovered%26utm_medium=email%26utm_source=TLDR/3/01000195f17cc3ac-f4557bfc-4ab9-4f05-bc7c-5ed16d7d1162-000000/q3XHlJIbRFp2GRMwhiyv4x30gUpkPXMhHnBfxJytb9s=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;report&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; summarizes data collected by the A10 security research team and provides a snapshot of a constantly changing global weapons landscape - including the &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fwww.a10networks.com%2Fresources%2Freports%2Fddos-weapons-report%2F%3Futm_campaign=DDoS-Attackers-Uncovered%26utm_medium=email%26utm_source=TLDR/4/01000195f17cc3ac-f4557bfc-4ab9-4f05-bc7c-5ed16d7d1162-000000/yC44hQEdAbJQf1xVJkFzMZA-aHjHtfEnAlIdl8LoYWA=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;sources, types, and other characteristics of DDoS weapons&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. The report covers:&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
