[2025-04-15 21:52:20,631][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    IssueOps is a methodology that uses GitHub Issues, GitHub Actions, and PRs as an interface for automating workflows. It provides an event driven, customizable, transparent, and immutable workflow system. When writing IssueOps workflows, it&apos;s helpful to think of the workflow as a finite-state machine consisting of states, events, transitions, guards, and actions. The post includes an example of how to build a team membership workflow using IssueOps.[\n]"
