[2025-04-15 21:52:20,644][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Your &lt;a href=&quot;https://tracking.tldrnewsletter.com/CL0/https:%2F%2Fmaterial.security%2Flp-google-workspace-security%3Futm_source=third-party%26utm_medium=email%26utm_campaign=20250331-tldrinfosec/1/01000195ec5ae3c1-1ac53ee4-e8b4-4fc5-b069-0ee8a93ad3e8-000000/4Mz_zQu7K_D2P1kXAZ68GnQNZTuZRePQysDKhv95mLc=398&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer nofollow&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Google Workspace&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt; or Microsoft 365 platform is where your company works, communicates, and collaborates [0xe2][0x80][0x94] it&apos;s your business&apos;s critical infrastructure. Protecting it with a patchwork of native security and point solutions leaves gaps [0xe2][0x80][0x93] the biggest being visibility &lt;em&gt;after&lt;/em&gt; an attacker has made it inside.[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:20,644][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "[\n]"
