[2025-04-15 21:52:20,645][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    A data leak on X, possibly due to a disgruntled employee, exposed information from 2.87 billion users. The leaked data includes a wealth of profile details but does not contain email addresses. Despite the massive breach, X has not acknowledged the incident publicly.[\n]"
