[2025-04-15 21:52:20,674][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    The Metropolitan Police will install permanent live facial recognition cameras in Croydon, London, to catch criminals by matching faces against a wanted list. Privacy campaigners strongly oppose the move, calling it a potential &quot;dystopian nightmare&quot; with no proper oversight.[\n]"
