[2025-04-15 21:52:20,693][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-18 << "                                    Many threat actors are recognized by various names. These designations vary based on different vendors&apos; conventions, such as Crowdstrike&apos;s use of animal names and Mandiant&apos;s APT classifications. This post features a list of threat actor names publicly disclosed by Microsoft, as well as additional names they are recognized by.[\n]"
