[2025-04-15 21:52:21,302][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,302][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-093-05 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-093-05&quot;&gt;B&amp;amp;R APROL&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
