[2025-04-15 21:52:21,308][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Notification&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Website Privacy Policy&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
