[2025-04-15 21:52:21,400][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;Wiz: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wiz.io/blog/github-action-tj-actions-changed-files-supply-chain-attack-cve-2025-30066&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;GitHub Action tj-actions/changed-files supply chain attack: everything you need to know&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;GitHub Action tj-actions/changed-files supply chain attack&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
