[2025-04-15 21:52:21,434][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA released three Industrial Control Systems (ICS) advisories on March 6, 2025. These advisories provide timely information about current security issues, vulnerabilities, and exploits surrounding ICS.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,434][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,434][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-065-01 &l"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,435][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "t;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-065-01&quot;&gt;Hitachi Energy PCU400&lt;/a&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,435][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
