[2025-04-15 21:52:21,435][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;li&gt;ICSA-25-037-02 &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-25-037-01&quot;&gt;Schneider Electric EcoStruxure (Update A)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,435][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,435][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;CISA encourages users and administrators to review newly released ICS advisories for technical details and mitigations.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
