[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cve.org/CVERecord?id=CVE-2023-34192&quot; title=&quot;Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite (ZCS) Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Vulnerability&quot;&gt;CVE-2023-34192&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]Synacor Zimbra Collaboration Suite (ZCS) Cross-Site Scripting (XSS) Vulnerability&lt;/li&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;/ul&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;Users and administrators are also encouraged to review the &lt;a href=&quot;https://unit42.paloaltonetworks.com/cve-2024-0012-cve-2024-9474/&quot;&gt;Palo Alto Threat Brief: Operation Lunar Peek&lt;/a&gt; related to CVE-2024-0012, &lt;a href=&quot;https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2024-0012&quot; title=&quot;https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2024-0012&quot;&gt;the Palo Alto Security Bulletin for CVE-2024-0012&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2024-9474&quot; title=&quot;https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2024-9474&quot;&gt;the Palo Alto Security Bulletin for CVE-2024-9474&lt;/a&gt; for additional information.[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;These types of vulnerabilities are frequent attack vectors for malicious cyber actors and pose significant risks to the federal enterprise.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/binding-operational-directive-22-01&quot; title=&quot;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Binding Operational Directive (BOD) 22-01: Reducing the Significant Risk of Known Exploited Vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]established the Known Exploited Vulnerabilities Catalog as a living list of known Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) that carry significant risk to the federal enterprise. BOD 22-01 requires Federal Civilian Executive Branch (FCEB) agencies to remediate identified vulnerabilities by the due date to protect FCEB networks against active threats. See the&lt;a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/sites/default/files/publications/Reducing_the_Significant_Risk_of_Known_Exploited_Vulnerabilities_211103.pdf&quot; title=&quot;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&quot;&gt;BOD 22-01 Fact Sheet&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]for more information.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;Although BOD 22-01 only applies to FCEB agencies, CISA strongly urges all organizations to reduce their exposure to cyberattacks by prioritizing timely remediation of[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog&quot; title=&quot;Catalog vulnerabilities&quot;&gt;Catalog vulnerabilities&lt;/a&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]as part of their vulnerability management practice. CISA will continue to add vulnerabilities to the catalog that meet the[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities&quot; title=&quot;specified criteria&quot;&gt;specified criteria&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:52:21,487][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-19 << "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;This product is provided subject to this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/notification&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Follow link&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Notification&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]and this[0xc2][0xa0]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cisa.gov/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; title=&quot;Follow link&quot; rel=&quot;noopener&quot;&gt;Privacy &amp;amp; Use&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span&gt;[0xc2][0xa0]policy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;[\n]"
